    "extraction_notes": [
      "The supplied three-page datasheet contains usable plots in Figs. 1 through 6; curve points are manual digitizations of plotted readings and are not interpolated values.",
      "The DC current gain table gives minimum hFE values of 80 at 1 mA, 100 at 10 mA, and 30 at 50 mA; it also gives a maximum hFE of 300 at 10 mA, which is recorded in this note because the schema stores one value per gain point.",
      "The transition-frequency table gives a minimum of 100 MHz and a maximum of 300 MHz; ft stores the guaranteed minimum.",
      "Cobo and Cibo have no tabulated numeric values in the supplied datasheet; both are represented by the digitized Fig. 6 curves and are null in specs where the schema requires a tabulated scalar.",
      "The static characteristic figure shows IB curves from 20 uA through 90 uA; the extraction includes the representative IB = 50 uA curve.",
      "Fig. 5 is labeled VCE = -5 V in the supplied image even though the part is identified as an NPN transistor; the figure label is preserved verbatim in the test conditions."
    ],
